--- code chat -
--maximize 	maximize the chat view
--profile=	open with a profile (created if it doesn't exist)
-a 	add files as context
-h 	show the help
-m 	the mode of the chat (or a custom mode's id; agent)
-n 	open an empty window
-r 	use the last active window
--- code chat --mode 
agent 
ask 
edit 
--- code tunnel 
help 	print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
kill 	stops any running tunnel on the system
prune 	delete all servers which are currently not running
rename 	rename the name of this machine associated with port forwarding service
restart 	restarts any running tunnel on the system
service 	(Preview) Manages the tunnel when installed as a system service,
status 	gets whether there is a tunnel running on the current machine
unregister 	remove this machine's association with the port forwarding service
--- code tunnel --n
--name=	sets the machine name for port forwarding service
--no-sleep 	prevents the machine going to sleep while this command runs
--- code tunnel user 
help 	print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
login 	log in to port forwarding service
logout 	log out of port forwarding service
show 	show the account that's logged into port forwarding service
=== meld
--- meld -
--auto-merge 	merge the files automatically
--comparison-file=	load a saved comparison (.meldcmp)
--diff 	a diff tab for the files or directories after it
--help-all 	show all the help
--help-gapplication 	show GApplication's options
--help-gtk 	show GTK's options
--version 	show the version
-L 	a label to use instead of a file's name (once for each)
-a 	compare all differing files on startup
-h 	show the help
-n 	open a new tab in the running meld
-o 	the file to save a merge to
-u 	ignored, for compatibility
--- meld --comparison-file 
data/
src/
